  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-mac-notify",
      "text": "监听 DSH 事件（任务完成、会话暂停、子agent结束、workflow完成），通过 SSH 在 Mac 上显示 terminal-notifier 悬浮气泡通知\n\n由 dsh-super-injector dev_scaffold_plugin 生成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "构建与注入",
      "text": "```bash\n(prebuilt - no build step required)"
    },
    {
      "section": "注入器环境内：dev_inject_plugin <本目录>",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "- DSH_MAC_NOTIFY_SSH - SSH target of the Mac that shows notifications, e.g. user@mac.local. Required; notifications are skipped when unset. Key-based auth must work non-interactively (BatchMode)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Mac-side listener",
      "text": "The plugin posts notifications over SSH to a small HTTP listener on the Mac (127.0.0.1:18923). Run the bundled example on the Mac:\n\nnode examples/mac-notifier-listener.mjs\n\nIt requires terminal-notifier (brew install terminal-notifier). Port and notifier binary are configurable via NOTIFY_PORT / NOTIFIER_BIN. For permanence, wrap it in a LaunchAgent."
    }
  ],
